<title>USA: Chartwell Leisure Q3 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Chartwell Leisure Q3 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>For The 3 Month	     For The 9 Month</p>
<p>			    Period Ended		   Period Ended</p>
<p>			    Sep 30, 1996*		 Sep 30, 1996*</p>
<p> Revenues		   $26,517,000		   $62,157,000</p>
<p> ADR				  62.81			   60.04</p>
<p> Occupancy			  76.1%			   69.9%</p>
<p> Rev Par			    47.80			   41.97</p>
<p> Net Loss (A)	     (4,724,000)		  (15,595,000)</p>
<p> Loss Per Share		   (.58)			  (2.34)</p>
<p> EBITDA before non-	 5,305,000		    10,948,000</p>
<p>cash provision for loss on gaming assets</p>
<p>(A)  Includes extraordinary charge of $1,477,000 relating to early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>* The Company does not believe that its 1996 and 1995 operating results can be meaningfully compared because of the change in the Company's business and asset base.</p>
</text>
